ernal'>http:\/\/bestdestinati....12\/index4.html<\/a><br \/> <br \/> @ kerri: thanks again for the info... now I only need to convince my fianc\u00a9 to begin with the ceremony a little earlier... I dont want to regret later that this special day was over too fast because we chose a later time :-(\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"chrissik82@googlemail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1260680287,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223885.PNG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":87,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"christinak82","Id":223885,"Name":"christinak82","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b2cd18695c95225c663ce4696d369ca1","RawContent":"oh and of course I am very excited to see some pics, kerri... :-)","Attachments":[],"Id":1121427,"PostDate":1271802526,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                oh and of course I am very excited to see some pics, kerri... :-)\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"chrissik82@googlemail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1260680287,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/pr