strong>jennypenny23<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">christinak82- I missed that thread!!! There are more GBP brides than I thought!! This is awesome! Thank you so much for the link.......I checked out the website and was very impressed.........I most certainly will be looking into that photog!!<br \/> Thanks again for your help!!!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>you\u00b4re welcome <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> thats why we\u00b4re all here, right? Good luck, hope you get a great deal.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"chrissik82@googlemail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1260680287,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223885.PNG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":87,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"christinak82","Id":223885,"Name":"christinak82","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c163098d818eafad10e677917450f43e","RawContent":"Thanks for posting a link to the other GBP blog! I didnt know there was another one!! I am starting to get super excited!! In 7 months I&#039;ll be married!! :) ....can&#039;t wait to see picture!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1127811,"PostDate":1272247210,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks for posting a link to the other GBP blog! I didnt know there was another one!! I am starting to get super excited!! In 7 months I'll be married!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> ....can't wait to see picture!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lchayim@rogers.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1265621673,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225422.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"StephAli","Id":225422,"Name":"StephAli","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bdb3f2e246654c6fe83794d84a1ea704","RawContent":"Alright! i have a few key pics on photobucket ready to share!! it&#039;s soooo hard to not post a gazillion! lol\n \n This is the looooong and beautiful walk way to the gazebo. you can hear the steel drum band the whole walk which is really nice. we had about 50 guests, which all fit in to the tiny area comfortably!\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i964.photobucket.com\/albums\/ae129\/mccrady\/GBP%20pics\/IMG_1109.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n A closer up shot of us int he gazebo during the ceremony. Make sure you find out what the script is...the one Rev. Owen Watson had was terrible, we wrote our entire thing, so was much better. \n We had our wedding party in the gazebo and choose to have our parents sitting up top near us too for optium viewing! lol\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i964.photobucket.com\/albums\/ae129\/mccrady\/GBP%20pics\/IMG_1162.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n Pic of the steel drum band during the champagne toast. they were to the right of the gazebo and were a great touch, worth the bucks!\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i964.photobucket.com\/albums\/ae129\/mccrady\/GBP%20pics\/IMG_1367.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n the cake...so beautiful!\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i964.photobucket.com\/albums\/ae129\/mccrady\/GBP%20pics\/IMG_1385.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n The dinner in Dolce vita was perfect for 50 of us, could easily fit more if they arranged the tables differently. was small enough for speaches to be heard easily too as there is no mic allowed.\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i964.photobucket.com\/albums\/ae129\/mccrady\/GBP%20pics\/IMG_1666.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n Head table :)\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i964.photobucket.com\/albums\/ae129\/mccrady\/GBP%20pics\/IMG_1672.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n Trash the Dress Day!! so fun!\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i964.photobucket.com\/albums\/ae129\/mccrady\/GBP%20pics\/jump35.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n my pic in my signature of the garter toss, is at the gazebo...there are 3 or 4 steps to this level, which is where our parents sat on the sides, and then the step up to where we were for the ceremony and where the dance was. so fun!\n \n i think that is a pic of each detail...any special pic requests, just let me know!\n \n and i didn&#039;t realize there was another active GBP thread, awesome!!! maybe i&#039;ll check it out too.\n \n have fun!","Attachments":[],"Id":1128703,"PostDate":1272315456,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Alright! i have a few key pics on photobucket ready to share!! it's soooo hard to not post a gazillion! lol<br \/> <br \/> This is the looooong and beautiful walk way to the gazebo. you can hear the steel drum band the whole walk which is really nice. we had about 50 guests, which all fit in to the tiny area comfortably!<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i964.photobucket.com\/albums\/ae129\/mccrady\/GBP%20pics\/IMG_1109.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> A closer up shot of us int he gazebo during the ceremony. Make sure you find out what the script is...the one Rev. Owen Watson had was terrible, we wrote our entire thing, so was much better. <br \/> We had our wedding party in the gazebo and choose to have our parents sitting up top near us too for optium viewing! lol<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i964.photobucket.com\/albums\/ae129\/mccrady\/GBP%20pics\/IMG_1162.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Pic of the steel drum band during the champagne toast. they were to the right of the gazebo and were a great touch, worth the bucks!<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i964.photobucket.com\/albums\/ae129\/mccrady\/GBP%20pics\/IMG_1367.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> the cake...so beautiful!<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i964.photobucket.com\/albums\/ae129\/mccrady\/GBP%20pics\/IMG_1385.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> The dinner in Dolce vita was perfect for 50 of us, could easily fit more if they arranged the tables differently. was small enough for speaches to be heard easily too as there is no mic allowed.<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i964.photobucket.com\/albums\/ae129\/mccrady\/GBP%20pics\/IMG_1666.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Head table <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i964.photobucket.com\/albums\/ae129\/mccrady\/GBP%20pics\/IMG_1672.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Trash the Dress Day!! so fun!<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i964.photobucket.com\/albums\/ae129\/mccrady\/GBP%20pics\/jump35.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> my pic in my signature of the garter toss, is at the gazebo...there are 3 or 4 steps to this level, which is where our parents sat on the sides, and then the step up to where we were for the ceremony and where the dance was. so fun!<br \/> <br \/> i think that is a pic of each detail...any special pic requests, just let me know!<br \/> <br \/> and i didn't realize there was another active GBP thread, awesome!!! maybe i'll check it out too.<br \/> <br \/> have fun!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/global.thebump.com\/tickers\/tt7a388.aspx\">http:\/\/global.thebump.com\/tickers\/tt7a388.aspx<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i964.photobucket.com\/albums\/ae129\/mccrady\/gartrepic.jpg\">http:\/\/i964.photobucket.com\/albums\/a...\/gartrepic.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kerrij@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1250884128,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-220796.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kerrij","Id":220796,"Name":"kerrij","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4bf5a3872e1e1bfb7c1895f42d2a43a3","RawContent":"omg kerri!! Thank you so much for sharing your pics!!! You look so beautiful and everything looked so perfect for your special day!!! I can&#039;t beleive how stunning the wedding gazebo looks in the pictures!! Im sure it is even more so up close!\n \n Everyone looks like theyre having a blast in the TTD photo!! hehe\n Congrats again and thanks so much for sharing your photos!!! ...Im more and more excited each time I check this thread!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1128842,"PostDate":1272319907,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                omg kerri!! Thank you so much for sharing your pics!!! You look so beautiful and everything looked so perfect for your special day!!! I can't beleive how stunning the wedding gazebo looks in the pictures!! Im sure it is even more so up close!<br \/> <br \/> Everyone looks like theyre having a blast in the TTD photo!! hehe<br \/> Congrats again and thanks so much for sharing your photos!!! ...Im more and more excited each time I check this thread!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jennyslack@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1262229008,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-224208.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jennypenny23","Id":224208,"Name":"jennypenny23","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2d0288579e964b5318f7f1d375d93340","RawContent":"I&#039;ve been missing out on the posts lately, glad to see there are some more brides!! :) \n \n Kerrij- LOVE the pics!!!!! You look beautiful! Could you post your photobucket album? I&#039;d love to see more!!!! Thanks!","Attachments":[],"Id":1129489,"PostDate":1272341148,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I've been missing out on the posts lately, glad to see there are some more brides!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> <br \/> <br \/> Kerrij- LOVE the pics!!!!! You look beautiful! Could you post your photobucket album? I'd love to see more!!!! Thanks!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mekanabr@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1259797911,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223677.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":299,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mekanabr","Id":223677,"Name":"mekanabr","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":5564,"TotalPages":557,"CurrentPage":70,"NextPage":80,"PreviousPage":60,"LastPage":5560},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
